# Mobile auth & navigation flows (frozen)

**Do not change step order, skip screens, or merge flows without explicit user approval.**

## Register path (new account)

`Register (details)` → `OTP` → `Terms & Privacy` (`legal-consent?from=register`) → `Onboarding` → `Pantry` → optional `Trial welcome` → `Dashboard (tabs)`

Onboarding sub-steps (fixed order):

1. Food preferences (diet + cuisines)
2. Notifications permission
3. Location permission

Implementation anchors: `register.tsx` (OTP → legal-consent), `legal-consent.tsx`, `onboarding.tsx`, `authNavigation.ts` (`pendingPantrySetup` → pantry), `trial-welcome.tsx`.

## Login path (existing account)

`Login` → `OTP` → `resolvePostAuthHref`:

- Onboarding **only if** `hasCompletedOnboarding` is false (full prefs → notifications → location).
- Else **permissions-only** flow (`onboarding?permissionsOnly=1`) when OS notification/location still missing.
- Then `Dashboard` (skip pantry unless `pendingPantrySetup`).

Login **must not** show legal-consent (register-only).

## Guest login (first time)

`Continue as guest` / splash auto-guest → `Terms & Privacy` (`legal-consent?from=guest`) → `Onboarding` → `Pantry` → `Dashboard`

Do **not** auto-complete onboarding with default prefs (`GUEST_DEFAULT_ONBOARDING`).

## Guest → sign up (upgrade)

`Settings` → **Sign up** → `Register` (not Login).

Guest may still use Login for returning accounts; Settings upgrade CTA goes to Register.

## Splash / cold start

Splash → bootstrap → auto guest when no session → route via `app/index.tsx`. Do not add Login/Register buttons on splash.

## Key files

| Concern | File |
|---------|------|
| Post-auth routing | `utils/authNavigation.ts` |
| Root redirect | `app/index.tsx` |
| Guest upgrade CTA | `app/(tabs)/settings/index.tsx`, `components/settings/SettingsBlocks.tsx` |
| New signup pantry gate | `AppContext.tsx` (`pendingPantrySetup` on signup) |
